	(label "CP2102_VDD"
		(at 264.16 106.68 0)
		(fields_autoplaced yes)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "862d135e-641d-4d75-9a75-e5f425d8c688")
	)
	(text "STRAPPING AUDIT (gate S2): IO0 pull-up R81 + SW2 (OK); IO2 -> R74 -> LED -> DGND (OK — jalur\nbeban tidak menarik IO2 rendah saat boot); IO5/IO12/IO15 NC & tidak keluar header (OK);\nEN: R80 10k + C83 1uF (tau 10 ms) + SW1 + auto-reset Q1. Semua ADC di ADC1 (IO32/33/34/35,\nVP=IO36, VN=IO39) — aman saat WiFi aktif. IO34/35/36/39 input-only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 56 62 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "932d7a50-c2e2-4863-8eda-ba7fb9ae30f9")	)
	(text "AUTO-RESET (standar DevKitC, silang): Q1: C=EN, E=RTS, B<-DTR(R87); Q2: C=IO0, E=DTR, B<-RTS(R88).\nTabel: DTR=0 & RTS=1 -> IO0 LOW (mode bootloader); DTR=1 & RTS=0 -> EN LOW (reset);\nDTR=RTS -> kedua transistor OFF (tidak ada aksi). esptool mengelola urutan otomatis."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 170 178 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b29266cf-856e-48f3-a517-970807e2be14")	)
	(text "VBUS_5V TIDAK terhubung +5V (anti-backfeed USB) — bukti netlist: tidak ada anggota +5V\ndi sheet ini; VBUS_5V hanya: J1 VBUS, U2 VBUS/VREGIN, U12 VBUS, C66, PWR_FLAG."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 224 24 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a37256e6-03cb-40d8-b69a-7a7ba5b5797c")	)
	(text "U2 CP2102N: VDD = output regulator internal 3,3 V (decouple C64 4,7uF + C65 100nF;\nVIO di-tie ke VDD; C66 100nF di VBUS_5V dekat U2). EP (pin 25) -> DGND via simbol\n(koinisiden pin GND). ~RST NC (pull-up internal). Level TXD/RXD/RTS/DTR = 3,3 V (VIO).\nFootprint: verifikasi EP 2,1x2,1 mm vs datasheet saat S9 (DN-S2-03)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 150 118 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ac75a683-4694-415d-8723-15236364fe87")	)
	(text "Decoupling U1: C80 10uF + C81/C82 100nF tepat di pin 3V3 modul (kontrak task spec S2#4)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 80 56 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3bfeed1c-05f0-4a31-a1f7-466ac66258fa")	)
	(text "J_PROGRAM: 1=3V3, 2=GND, 3=TX, 4=RX, 5=EN, 6=IO0 (header 2,54 di tepi zona digital — S7)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 36 162 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fe89ade3-084c-4f0a-b617-d300093d00e3")	)
	(text "GPIO5/12/15 NC: tidak dipakai & tidak keluar header (pin map §2). NC internal U1/U2\nsudah bertipe no_connect pada simbol resmi."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 56 128 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d1e7d2af-69c5-42ce-ba0d-8e6ed36b1465")	)
	(text_box "02_ESP32 — blok digital controller (S2).\nU1 ESP32-WROOM-32E: pin map §2 brief TERKUNCI (RS485_DIR=IO4, E_STOP_SENSE=IO14,\n  RS485=IO16/17, PZEM=IO18/19, I2C=IO21/22, CAN=IO25/26, RELAY=IO27, ADC: IO32/33/34/35,\n  VP/VN=IO36/39; IO5/12/15 NC; semua ADC di ADC1).\nEN: R80 10k + C83 1uF + SW1. BOOT: R81 10k + SW2. Auto-reset 2x S8050 (DevKitC, silang).\nU2 CP2102N: VBUS/VREGIN <- VBUS_5V (J1 USB-C GCT USB4105 via USBLC6-2SC6 seri);\n  VDD reg internal + VIO tie; EP pin25 -> DGND; decouple C64/65/66.\n  CC1/CC2 5,1k (R85/R86). J_PROGRAM 6-pin. LED status GPIO2.\nVBUS_5V TIDAK tersambung +5V (anti-backfeed) — netlist proof di validasi skrip.\nNet baru S2 (dok. design-notes §3): UART0_TX/RX, USB_DP_P/DM_P, GPIO13/23/33/36/39, RTS, DTR."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(size 180 45)
		(stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type none))
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "574cf233-838d-40e3-9215-1651ca037e57")
	)
